### Prior Fix (Deployed Successfully)
Three regex bugs in `InjectHead`, `rerenderStripWrapper`, and `cleanHTMLStructure` were fixed — they were matching `<head` when they should have matched `<header>` (or vice versa). After that fix, the header nav renders correctly on index.html — the remaining issue is just **which pages** appear in nav, which is what the 3 fixes above address.

